  partName: Left Exhaust Manifold Bolt
  description: The Left Exhaust Manifold Bolt is a tiny, elongated bolt located at
    the top-left-center of the engine, made of Material.001, which secures the exhaust
    manifold in place, ensuring proper exhaust gas flow and preventing leaks. This
    bolt is crucial for maintaining engine performance and reducing emissions. Interestingly,
    its elongated shape allows for easy access and tightening.
